      "description": "attempt\\ to\\ calculate\\ the\\ remainder\\ with\\ a\\ divisor\\ of\\ zero",
      "role": "defensive_branch",
      "reason": "The rhs == 0 match arm returns before remainder; zero-divisor error branch is defensive.",
      "target_wrapper_relation": "LIBRARY_ARITHMETIC_GUARD"
    },
    {
