      "role": "defensive_branch",
      "reason": "Macro index i is a literal in 1..31, so i - 1 cannot underflow. This is an arithmetic error guard, not the model_sorted result or required relation assertion.",
      "target_wrapper_relation": "DEFENSIVE_CHECK_WITHIN_TARGET_OR_MODEL"
    },
    {
      "id": "model-count-add",
