      "role": "defensive_branch",
      "reason": "c starts at zero and has at most 32 single increments; overflow is outside the bounded model. The required model-count equality is not exempted.",
      "target_wrapper_relation": "DEFENSIVE_CHECK_WITHIN_TARGET_OR_MODEL"
    },
    {
